Subject: [PATCH] slurp: make librt optional on iOS

iOS has clock_gettime() in libc and no separate librt.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build	2023-12-14 02:55:54
+++ b/meson.build	2026-07-04 23:46:35
@@ -15 +15 @@
-realtime = cc.find_library('rt')
+realtime = cc.find_library('rt', required: false)
